WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:24.620
Riley: We're ready for our first meeting of the Pet Lovers Club.

2
00:00:24.621 --> 00:00:28.402
Ben: Those snacks look good!

3
00:00:28.403 --> 00:00:32.432
Riley: Hey, those are dog treats!

4
00:00:32.433 --> 00:00:34.990
Ben: Ugh. Oops.

5
00:00:34.991 --> 00:00:41.008
Mrs. Summers: Here are your treats!

6
00:00:41.009 --> 00:00:45.739
Riley: Snooks, are you ready for the first meeting?

7
00:00:45.740 --> 00:00:48.836
Snooks: Ar-ooo!

8
00:00:48.837 --> 00:00:53.554
Ben: Someone's here.

9
00:00:53.555 --> 00:00:57.966
Riley: Oh, hi, Skyler. Come in.

10
00:00:57.967 --> 00:01:01.003
Skyler: I saw your poster for the Pet Lovers Club.

11
00:01:01.004 --> 00:01:02.997
I'm so excited!

12
00:01:02.998 --> 00:01:05.925
Chatter: Bad boy, brush your teeth!

13
00:01:05.926 --> 00:01:08.513
Skyler: Meet Chatter, my parrot.

14
00:01:08.514 --> 00:01:11.410
Chatter: Squawk! Did you do your homework?

15
00:01:11.411 --> 00:01:15.616
Ben: He sounds just like my mom!

16
00:01:15.617 --> 00:01:18.882
Theo: Hi. Is this the Pet Lovers Club?

17
00:01:18.883 --> 00:01:22.047
Riley: Yes, come in.

18
00:01:22.048 --> 00:01:24.266
Theo: My name is Theo.

19
00:01:24.267 --> 00:01:27.509
I love pets.

20
00:01:27.510 --> 00:01:32.137
Theo: This is my hamster, Whiskers, and this frog is—

21
00:01:32.138 --> 00:01:35.648
Theo: Frankie, come back!

22
00:01:35.649 --> 00:01:38.584
Ben: Ha-ha! He's a good jumper.

23
00:01:38.585 --> 00:01:46.919
Theo: I'm trying to teach him better manners.

24
00:01:46.920 --> 00:01:49.748
Sarah: Can I come in?

25
00:01:49.749 --> 00:01:52.632
Skyler: This is Sarah.

26
00:01:52.633 --> 00:01:56.547
She lives in the yellow house on the corner.

27
00:01:56.548 --> 00:01:58.472
Ben: This is Speedy.

28
00:01:58.473 --> 00:02:01.516
Where's your pet, Sarah?

29
00:02:01.517 --> 00:02:05.505
Sarah: I, um, my pet is a secret.

30
00:02:05.506 --> 00:02:07.905
Riley: A secret?

31
00:02:07.906 --> 00:02:11.928
Sarah: Yes. A really big secret.

32
00:02:11.929 --> 00:02:15.179
Theo: But you can't keep your pet a secret.

33
00:02:15.180 --> 00:02:19.224
Ben: We're going to teach our pets tricks.

34
00:02:19.225 --> 00:02:25.376
Riley: And take them places!

35
00:02:25.377 --> 00:02:30.718
Sarah: The truth is—I don't have a pet!

36
00:02:30.719 --> 00:02:37.296
Chatter: Uh-oh!
